Well, I'm finding the classes pretty tough actually, but I'm having a great time in Shanghai.

205
00:09:14,430 --> 00:09:15,550
It's really an amazing city.

206
00:09:15,950 --> 00:09:16,590
It sure is.

207
00:09:17,130 --> 00:09:17,990
Are you staying for long?

208
00:09:18,450 --> 00:09:19,650
Only two weeks, unfortunately.

209
00:09:20,560 --> 00:09:22,110
I wish I could stay longer, but...

210
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:25,950
Well, listen, if you need someone to show you the sites, then just call me.

211
00:09:26,480 --> 00:09:29,190
I'm having a little get together at my new apartment next week.

212
00:09:29,430 --> 00:09:31,170
So if you want to drop by then.

213
00:09:31,170 --> 00:09:31,770
That sounds great.

214
00:09:32,030 --> 00:09:32,470
I'd love to.

215
00:09:32,730 --> 00:09:33,890
Let me take down your number, Michelle.

216
00:09:38,420 --> 00:09:41,120
Okay, so this is part one of our small talk series.

217
00:09:41,400 --> 00:09:52,480
We're going to have 10 episodes and in each episode we're going to be faced with a little different situation or circumstance where we will be forced to have a very quick chat with someone.

218
00:09:52,480 --> 00:09:53,480
That's right.

219
00:09:53,480 --> 00:10:00,310
And you're often going to find yourself in these situations if you're traveling to an English speaking country or you're living or working in America, for example.

220
00:10:01,160 --> 00:10:05,160
And so it's really important because I think oftentimes you don't learn this in class.

221
00:10:05,160 --> 00:10:09,990
This is something that you have to really learn when you're in the country or learn with us here at EnglishPod.

222
00:10:10,240 --> 00:10:10,390
That's right.

223
00:10:11,240 --> 00:10:15,700
It's a little bit of social skills for these awkward or maybe new situations.

224
00:10:16,160 --> 00:10:17,160
Exactly.

225
00:10:17,160 --> 00:10:18,160
All right.

226
00:10:18,160 --> 00:10:22,040
So if you guys have any other questions or doubts, you can find us at EnglishPod.com and we'll see everyone there.

227
